{
  "_comment": [
    "Sol Styles' parts: each is one thing on screen a style can change, as patterns of paths under assets/minecraft/.",
    "The build resolves the patterns against each Minecraft version's own client jar (the styleParts task), so a part",
    "lists exactly the files that version has; nothing here names a path for one version only. '*' is any text inside",
    "one folder, '**' any folders. kind: block (always opaque, never off), item, entity, overlay, gui, particle, sky.",
    "off: the part may be switched off (rule B.0.4). live: its colours can change without a reload (same-size",
    "textures). icon: the texture its tiles show (the first pattern that matches on the version)."
  ],
  "tabs": ["crystal", "anchor", "armor", "tools", "inventory", "fire", "sky", "deepslate", "stone", "snow"],
  "groups": ["combat", "tools", "armour", "world", "screen"],
